# EDK2 UefiPayloadPkg payload, built by the edk2-uefipayload recipe (the
# MrChromebox fork coreboot itself defaults to) and consumed here as a
# prebuilt payload file -- cbfstool's add-payload detects the FV signature
# and converts it (parse_fv_to_payload). @UEFIPAYLOAD@ is substituted by the
# recipe's do_configure.
#
# NOT using CONFIG_PAYLOAD_EDK2: that path has coreboot's make clone and
# build edk2 inside do_compile; the Yocto recipe replaces it. Because of
# that, the options the board port only `select`s under PAYLOAD_EDK2 &&
# SMMSTORE must be set explicitly:
#   SMMSTORE (+0x80000 size, matching the port's SMMSTORE(PRESERVE) FMAP
#   region), the EFI variable store as the option backend, and the CFR
#   setup menu (fan profile, power-on-after-AC, Turbo, SATA, fTPM) that the
#   payload's SetupMenu renders.
CONFIG_PAYLOAD_ELF=y
CONFIG_PAYLOAD_FILE="@UEFIPAYLOAD@"
CONFIG_SMMSTORE=y
CONFIG_SMMSTORE_SIZE=0x80000
CONFIG_DRIVERS_OPTION_CFR_ENABLED=y
CONFIG_DRIVERS_EFI_VARIABLE_STORE=y
